WEBVTT

00:09:56.916 --> 00:10:00.476
We also had to, for the bigger
skull block and the body block,

00:10:00.516 --> 00:10:04.676
we also had to create a wooden frame
to help support the immense weight.

00:10:07.276 --> 00:10:10.516
After various challenges on site,

00:10:10.516 --> 00:10:13.036
we finally managed to remove
the entire skeleton

00:10:13.036 --> 00:10:16.076
after dissecting it into several
more manageable blocks.

00:10:16.396 --> 00:10:19.556
But this one block here,
which is the main body block,

00:10:19.556 --> 00:10:22.476
this weighed one and a half tons.

00:10:22.516 --> 00:10:24.836
It's actually being removed,
which is quite nice,

00:10:24.836 --> 00:10:28.196
it's actually being removed by Joe Davis,
who found the ichthyosaur.

00:10:28.236 --> 00:10:30.436
And this was an interesting
moment for the team